# Links lychee must not check (regular expressions, one per line), because CI cannot check them.
# Kept here rather than in .github/workflows/links.yml, where lychee would read the patterns as links.

# The Sync server answers 404 to a plain GET: it only serves the app's POST API.
^https://spanish-progress\.spanish-trainer\.workers\.dev
# The Durable Object's internal request URL in worker/src/router.js, not a real host.
^https://profile/
